        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Rylance, Rudolf Abel, Vilyam \"Willie\" Genrikhovich Fisher\n- Works: Bridge of Spies\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor, BAFTA Award for Best Supporting Actor\n- Roles: Soviet intelligence officer\n\nFacts:\n- Rudolf Ivanovich Abel, whose real name was Vilyam \"Willie\" Genrikhovich Fisher, was born on July 11, 1903, and died on November 15, 1971.\n- Rudolf Ivanovich Abel was a Soviet intelligence officer.\n- In 2015, Mark Rylance portrayed Rudolf Abel in the film \"Bridge of Spies.\"\n- Mark Rylance won the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor and the BAFTA Award for Best Supporting Actor for portraying Rudolf Abel in \"Bridge of Spies.\"",
